<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-S15-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-S15-004" ;
  triage:title "sprint-S15-rusqlite-hardening.md Closeout Requirements missing REQ-P-RUNTIME-002 gate" ;
  triage:description "The Closeout Requirements section of docs/phase-S/sprint-S15-rusqlite-hardening.md does not explicitly gate on the daemon-singleton-writer invariant (REQ-P-RUNTIME-002). sprint-S15-rusqlite-plan.md line 99 names REQ-P-RUNTIME-002 and ADR-002 as the correctness dependency for SqliteWriter's single-process write serialization. Add one line to Closeout Requirements referencing REQ-P-RUNTIME-002 to make the constraint visible at the sprint authority level." ;
